{"v":4,"catch":"正義的代言人 BRAVOMAN 來了！","desc":"《BRAVOMAN》是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於 1988 年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n一天，普通上班族Hitoshi Nakamura 結束了漫長的一天工作，在回家的路上遇到了 Alpha Man。\nAlpha Man於是將超能轉化材料託付給他，要他用它來阻止瘋狂科學家Dr. Bomb接管世界。\n他變身為正義與勇氣的英雄……被稱為BRAVOMAN！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-06-08","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/33ed0d283088ca12d8c5c1a2e3dd3ee64747cdee05a002e29e9b2d3903376120.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d25c2c03105ad4e36e04ce1408ca443a7b5eb6ace9e02105e0d2bb349968b7f0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/62042d2a166d20bb3f21dce25e2acd649e4dcb6e8b7fc59df3c427157e59c7b8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/21012dc6b24a1e8a8cb40f490e5ad52254c09d41dfde297fe27916b5048b7053.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5f69437b128798e50203a97f64dd8a7ccab66afd8cf64ee821d10fa35e8b6e9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8d2788be443251044b3c740864cfcad39bb8b4fe34a62447f4a9d3929812d195.jpg"],"titleId":"01009a801a6a0000","dlc":[]}